    "summary": "Seventy thousand years ago, humanity was on the verge of extinction until a group of Immortals created the Veil, splitting Earth into two realities: one that has the Earth we know, and an alternate Earth where all that we have come to know as mythology thrives.  Now the Veil has been shattered and the two worlds are collapsing into each other with catastrophic consequences.  You and your friends are among the rare few who can wield magic and defend humanity against this cataclysm.\nBreach is a fast-paced third person co-op action RPG.  Create your own character, customize your appearance, and choose from dozens of classes with gameplay inspired by multiple genres.  Launch your enemies in the air and juggle them with rapid attacks.  Play as a classic support healer.  Sit on the edge of the a",
