    "summary": "In the game, you will control a ninja warrior. You can run, jump, cling to the walls with a hook. You need to get to the exit to complete the level. There will be various obstacles on your way. Collect coins to get more stars. Controls: Run - AD / Left, Right arrows. Jump - W / Up arrow / Space Throw a hook - LMB After purchasing, you will receive a ninja game with interesting gameplay, where you will need to move deftly, overcome obstacles and collect coins to reach new levels and earn stars. This is a game that will test your control skills and reaction.",
