    ],
    "summary": "BreakThru (ブレーク スルー, Bureikusurū) is a Data East vehicular combat arcade game that was later made available for the Nintendo Entertainment System and various personal computers. The goal is to drive a dune buggy to \"breakthru\" the enemy lines of five different areas. The five areas are \"Mountain\", \"Bridge\", \"Prairie\" (labeled as \"Jungle\" in early advertising), \"City\" and \"Recover the Aircraft\".",
