    ],
    "summary": "Victory Road (怒号層圏, Dogō Sōken, lit. \"Bellowing Atmosphere\") an arcade video game released in 1986. It is the sequel to Ikari Warriors.\nThe objective is to defeat the enemy aliens using grenades and other weapons. The story directly picks up at the ending of Ikari Warriors. Congratulated by General Kawasaki for rescuing him, Paul and Vince return home to their native country in a plane arranged by the general. A mysterious storm appears and they are hurtled thousands of years into the future. They are met by an alien creature who says that the villain Zang Zip has taken over the land.",
