    ],
    "summary": "V is a video game based on the popular 1984-5 TV series of the same name. It was developed by Ocean Software The programmer was Grant Harrison.\nIn the role of Mike Donovan the player must infiltrate an alien mothership, destroy the craft and escape alive. The opening scene is a docking bay and your objectives are to spread the red dust to take out the alien visitors and set 5 bombs in strategic locations to blow up the mothership. The player must solve many puzzles in order to progress and complete the game.",
