    "poster": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/3b8/3b8abab49a324c9d69fdc6792090ff8b.jpg",
    "gallery": [
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/947/947ac0158a3a09a14ce51aa40a156c43.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/ece/ece51b91dc30d401a94603a78ea41214.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/5ce/5ce6ff3708ec76bd63a8c13339f9a05a.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/c77/c774321c882023eced9398123ff6fadc.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/694/694cf4e5eb12514c90c2b6ff70d101db.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/179/1798c1b3f8f4f5c590e69b1247397dd8.jpg"
    ],
    "summary": "Falcon Collection includes the following:\n- Falcon\n- Falcon A.T.\n- Falcon Gold (featuring the complete collection of updated versions of Falcon 3.0 , MiG-29, Operation: Fighting Tiger and Art of the Kill dogfighting video)\n- Falcon 4.0 (version 1.08, Windows only, added as a part of the bonus goodies pack)\nThe bogey came out of nowhere. You see him just off your tail. The adrenalin hits you like a fist. You call your wingman: \"Viper One, I've got a bandit on my six. This is not good...\"\nYou go to afterburner and your Falcon jumps, slamming you back in the seat. The MiG 29 has just reached missile range... There! He's fired, the deadly rocket screams toward you, seeing nothing but the heat of your exhaust. Without thinking, you drop a series of flares hoping to confuse it, and yank back on ",
    "developer": "Spectrum Holobyte",
    "reviews": []
  },
