    "summary": "You are Rambo, the super hero of the movies. And you come to life on your own screen. You must go deep into enemy territory to rescue your comrades from concentration camps. Blow those camps. And escape with your skin. It's no picnic. You're menaced by infantry. Artillery. Flame throwers and rocket launchers. Everything the enemy can throw at you. So you must use every tactic at your command. Your weapons? Your M-60. A supply of arrow-bombs. Your savage strength. And steel nerves. And remember. You take no prisoners.",
