    "summary": "Across the galaxy, there exists a distant planet known as Gradius.\nGradius' peaceful existence has been brought to an end by an intense\nspace invasion by a race known as the Bacterion. To save the planet, the\nhyperspace fighter Vic Viper has been deployed to fight the Bacterion\ninvasion. Players pilot the Vic Viper through seven stages, shooting and\ndodging through deadly obstacles, while using various power-ups,\nincluding missiles, lasers, options and shields. The Vic Viper's target\nis the enemy fortress, Xaerous. The only way to end the war is to plunge\ndeep through the enemy forces and destroy its very core.\nThis classic game is part of the Virtual Console service, which brings you great games created for consoles such as NES™, Super NES™ and Game Boy™ Advance. We hope you'll enjoy the ",
