    ],
    "summary": "Time Tunnel is a computer game for the Commodore 64. The aim of the game is to teleport between different ages to solve puzzles, find \"The Seven Scriptures\" and become King of the Gnomes. The different locations you move between in the game are:\nThe Gnome Mansion, where the time machine is assembled\nStone Age, 9600 BC\nMagical Persia, 893 BC\nMythological Greece, 86 BC\nColonial Salem, Massachusetts, 1692 AD\nCalifornia Gold Rush, 1849 AD\nIntergalactic Spaceship, 3456 AD\nThe Black Hole, 9999 AD",
