    "gallery": [],
    "summary": "The Universe is threatened by the mighty LORD CHAOSBRINGER, a primeval entity who has unleashed its chaotic hordes of elemental forces. The Universe needs YOU to defeat the forces of chaos and CLAIM THE TITLE of the MASTER BLASTER. Your journey will be difficult but fulfilling… Here is what you should be expecting:Blasting ActionAIM and SHOOT your blasters against attacking hordes of elemental particles.\nAvoid, or take advantage of OBSTACLES and HAZARDS.\nDeal with unexpected air hockey-inspired PHYSICS behaviors and make them work for you, or they will not!Campaign Mode: Explore - Upgrade - Eliminate8 Galaxies to EXPLORE  with 50 Levels of gameplay.\nPower-up by completing levels and earning powerful REWARDS. By becoming stronger you will UNLOCK new Star Systems.\nMake it to the FINAL battle",
    "developer": "Silly",
    "reviews": []
  },
