      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/6b0/6b0789df99ac23ba9316e4a8aca9f827.jpg"
    ],
    "summary": "The Screamer is set in a dark futuristic environment. The existence of a megalopolis called Beast City depends on a huge complex known as \"Biological Intelligence in Artificial System\" (sic), usually referred to as simply \"BIAS\". But recently, disturbances within BIAS have been reported. Apparently, dangerous creatures have gone rampant. Nobody dares to venture inside - except, naturally, the protagonist of this game...\n\nThe game is a somewhat unusual mixture of first-person dungeon crawler and side-scrolling action. Following a simple character creation, the player is taken to the Beast City, where it is possible to rest, buy equipment for the hero, and hear the latest gossip. Afterwards, the player can venture into the depths of BIAS, which is a huge maze-like dungeon. Enemies attack ran",
    "developer": "Neznámý vývojář",
    "reviews": []
  },
