      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/c16/c16bc153167cff3b6b776b8b9c034aa5.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/52f/52f5e710c91a64bb263d72eaf671761b.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/6bf/6bf96c5f9ebd8026ac2f79cfbb71858a.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/a83/a83caa3caafc6e8f912a1ff59b373b6f.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/3cf/3cfa1c30add749dd3f03203bd072a62b.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/fbc/fbc6b228f013117fa7822283ca39d9aa.jpg"
    ],
    "summary": "SunDog: Frozen Legacy is a 1984 space trading and combat simulator video game. SunDog was first developed for the Apple II, with version 1.0 being released in March 1984, and version 1.1 (bug fixes) released three weeks later. Version 2.0, which included enhancements and improved performance, was released in October, 1984. A greatly enhanced version was released for the Atari ST in December 1985. Although FTL intended to release further games in the series, this was pre-empted by the tremendous success of their follow-on effort, Dungeon Master.\nThe first game produced by FTL Games, and the only game programmed by Bruce Webster, SunDog not only stored an impressive amount of data in the limited 64K of the Apple II, it also implemented a GUI inspired by the pioneering interface developed at ",
    "developer": "FTL Games",
    "reviews": []
  },
  {
    "title": "Arctic Fox",
    "rawg_id": 32999,
    "year": 1984,
    "date": "1984-01-01",
    "score": null,
    "genre": "Adventura, RPG, Simulace",
    "platforms": [
      "PC",
      "iOS"
    ],
    "poster": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/891/89192085eb5725400039a95fc8bdcc0c.jpg",
    "gallery": [
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/bef/befac6d8e57bbbeacbc252e45411d650.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/822/82209c014ea8c281bf872633d79e8fca_SajWx4Y.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/4b6/4b6e24da8aa315109cf39439f8d3f849.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/f9a/f9abfc1340f7eac471d3d1d00618588c.jpg",
      "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/a16/a16866646937ec3b57e1a5f7727b0e84.jpg"
    ],
    "summary": "From deep in the arctic circle, a young fox awakens. You must help him survive and thrive against the harsh winter conditions. He's ready to fish and hunt down rabbits to build up his strength.  Once he is big enough, his objective is to defeat all his enemies.  This 3D wild animal simulator allows you to take control of this ferocious Arctic Fox as he freely roams near and far to hunt his enemies. Help him grow up to fight the big animal bosses.  Find your 2 mates and start your thriving family. The realistic 3D map is massive so take your time to explore all the areas to find all the bosses. Animal simulation at its best.\nThe goal of the game is to defeat all 5 bosses. The 5 bosses includes Wolf, Polar Bear, Orca, Sea Lion, and Moose.  Of course we threw in some eagles and rabbits also. ",
    "developer": "Electronic Arts",
    "reviews": []
  },
