    ],
    "summary": "Food Fight (also styled as Charley Chuck's Food Fight) is an arcade game released by Atari, Inc. in March 1983. The player guides Charley Chuck, who is trying to eat an ice cream cone before it melts, while avoiding four chefs bent on stopping him. The game sold 1,951 video game arcade cabinets.\nFood Fight was released for the Atari 7800 console in 1986, and also released as an Atari 8-bit family cartridge styled for the Atari XEGS in 1989. A port for the Atari 2600 was canceled.",
    "developer": "General Computer",
    "reviews": []
