    "summary": "Return of the Jedi: Death Star Battle is a shoot 'em up video game published by Parker Brothers in 1983 for the Atari 2600, Atari 5200, and Atari 8-bit family. In 1984 it was published for the Sinclair ZX Spectrum. It was the second Star Wars-related video game ever to be released, following Star Wars: The Empire Strikes Back in 1982, and the first released video game to be based on the film Return of the Jedi.",
