    "summary": "Five games in one, Party Mix is a collection title developed in 1983 by Starpath for the Starpath Supercharger add-on to the Atari 2600 console. Being one of the first party video games, it became notable for its inventive one-on-one and two-on-two split-screen multiplayer gameplay types.\nThe anthology consists of the following titles:\nBop a Buggy\nTug of War\nWizard's Keep\nDown on the Line\nHandcar",
