    ],
    "summary": "Ever since Aunt Gertrude gave you that pith helmet for your birthday you have been trying to find a job that would require you to don khakis and your exotic chapeau. While hitchhiking through the Southwest, you stopped for lunch at the 'Dillo Diner in Nihil, Texas. The woman behind the counter noticed your helmet and mentioned that Professor Arrowhead \"over to the university\" was looking for \"some crazy to go to the jungle.\"\n\nIntrigued, you headed over to Flint University, located in the Tarsand Trailer Park, to talk to this Arrowhead character. The professor turned out in be a rather persuasive fellow with a well-stocked bar, and before you know it you found yourself on a plane bound for Iquitos, Peru, armed with S6,000, a degree in Archeology printed on the back of a matchbox, and a miss",
    "developer": "Penguin Software",
    "reviews": []
  },
