    "genre": "Plošinovka",
    "platforms": [],
    "poster": "",
    "gallery": [],
    "summary": "Donkey Kong II is a Game & Watch game released as a part of the Multi Screen series on March 7, 1983. It was later rereleased as part of Game & Watch Gallery 3. It is an indirect sequel to the Donkey Kong Jr. Game & Watch game and a direct follow-up to Donkey Kong. While Donkey Kong Jr. is based on the first level of the arcade game of the same name, Donkey Kong II appears to be based on the third and fourth levels. \n\nThe above text is from the Super Mario Wiki and is available under a Creative Commons license. Attribution must be provided through a list of authors or a link back to the original article. Source: https://www.mariowiki.com/Donkey_Kong_II",
    "developer": "Nintendo",
    "reviews": []
  },
