    ],
    "summary": "A SECRET, AN EMERGENCY OR SIMPLY, SIMPLY A LOVE MESSAGE THAT MR. POSTMAN CAREFULLY CARRIES AND WALKS IN SUCH A HURRY?\nIN THIS DARK STORMING NIGHT, IT IS THE MIGHTY OR THE NAUGHTY THAT IS THROWING DOWN ALL HIS SPEARS AND COMMAND LIGHTNING FROM THE SKY?\nA-HA, HOWEVER, IT IS STILL MOST FREE TO FLY. MAY YOU GIVE HIM A HAND, MR. POSTMAN IS REACHING THE SILEND LAND.\nA JUNGLE? A TUNNEL? BUT WHO CAN GUESS IT IS HEAVEN OR HELL BEHIND.",
