    "summary": "Star Strike is a single-player video game, released by Mattel for its Intellivision video game system in 1982. The Intellivision's best-selling game in 1982, with over 800,000 copies sold, Star Strike was inspired by the famous \"trench run\" sequence in the 1977 film Star Wars, as the player must drop bombs on alien weapons silos before Earth moves into range.",
