    ],
    "summary": "Welcome to STAR BASE SQUADRON COMMAND.\n\nYou have been recalled from your leave because PLANET \"SPECTRA\" in SECTOR \"S\" GALAXY has been invaded.\n\nEach pilot will be given a MISSION CARTRIDGE with the latest laser films of the planet surface.\nThe \"T.I.A.'s\" have installed MISSILES BASES throughout the planet surface.\nThey are known to be placed in groups of 3.\n\nAfter you enter the PLANET STRATOSPHERE, search and destroy all ENEMY BASES.\n\nOur advance landing parties have constructed landing strips for refueling.\nWatch your fuel level and refuel whenever possible.\n\nThe enemy will fire DRONE MISSILES at you, shoot as many of these down as possible.",
    "developer": "Spectravideo",
    "reviews": []
  },
